{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0443_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c7cdd70b13cb2b771cbf324d3e52b3d58919d16485cb00cdf409e5b3f0314428", "ja": "（お昼休憩中。外の空気を吸うために、\n劇場の周りを歩いていると……）", "zh": "（午休时间。为了呼吸一下外面的空气，正在剧场周围散步……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0443_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "6fee11e4856132c04b948f8b280cf0b68bb1d0e3f8d1de3aae1a2797c1ff97b5", "ja": "ふぅ……つ、疲れた～……。", "zh": "呼……累、累死我了～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0443_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f9680b1117b2d8915d04db89ba7b27f5629f7d6c68c15f83c3d6fd6a5ca35746", "ja": "あれ、百合子？\nこんなところで、何してるんだ？", "zh": "咦，百合子？\n你在这里做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0443_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "51165e25e383a0dd5a9be481e3fa03d06e1b28bff0a029ad95ee498f05337687", "ja": "{$P$}さん。実はさっきまで、\n昴さんとキャッチボールをしてたんです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生。其实直到刚才，\n我都在和昂同学玩传接球呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0443_1004_p", "source_sha256": "026e852b73c24cbeee6194bea8e0da905b485b2ea595298b580c37da3eca0c0f", "ja": "珍しいな。百合子が野球なんて……。", "zh": "真少见啊。百合子居然会打棒球……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0443_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "e65103ddb67e92a09e5429a961b93cfaef592d55aadef772c67638fbbf2dca7e", "ja": "えへへ。この前の野球大会の影響で……。\nルールを覚えたら、ちょっと楽しいなって思って。", "zh": "嘿嘿……受上次棒球大会的影响……\n学会规则后，我觉得还挺有意思的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0443_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "9649f1fc00e11df305a62cfc48a403876aab8c337587ac015d307653b1e2ccfd", "ja": "そしたら、昴さんが誘ってくれたんです。まあ、\n準備運動のキャッチボールで既に疲れてますけど……。", "zh": "然后，昴前辈邀请我一起打球了。虽然在做准备运动传接球的时候就已经累了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0443_1007_p", "source_sha256": "468e8611f28035cbbce8fef4db9ddab366bb3eb37cbf54194c332dd344254dd3", "ja": "はは。けど、いいことじゃないか。\n以前なら、苦手な運動ってだけで青ざめてたからな。", "zh": "哈哈。不过，这不是件好事吗？\n以前的话，只要想到是不擅长的运动，就已经脸色发白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0443_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "6f05c2a56889fbaf8238cfd818af5f6491a2ef67b11fe8afc21fc225bf20bb98", "ja": "はい……。だから自分でも驚いてるんです。意識を\n変えちゃうくらい野球大会が楽しかったのかなって。", "zh": "是的……所以连我自己都很惊讶。棒球大会是不是开心到让我改变了想法呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0443_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "15e703e861efb83fb4be84ed1527ffd4db9d0cb497f357ac38db24d45b4e6961", "ja": "運動は苦手ですし、絶対足を引っ張っちゃうって、\n最初はドキドキしてたんですけど……。", "zh": "我不擅长运动，而且一开始还紧张得不得了，想着自己肯定会拖大家后腿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0443_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "c04ed4536521e2bab9a9610ef7584c3fa5ff0af6e4a0f12995d75805aeca915e", "ja": "私がミスしても、みんなが励ましてくれて……\nそれがすごく、嬉しかったんです。", "zh": "就算我出了失误，大家也会来鼓励我……\n这让我真的好开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0443_1011_p", "source_sha256": "77c8330dd173e014df81e71f9ca250ff8f28c6ef6fd59ecf7991fa43ad8cb50b", "ja": "そうか。野球はチームプレイって言うものな。\n仲間の思いが、百合子の緊張を解いてくれたんだな。", "zh": "这样啊。毕竟，棒球讲究的是团队配合嘛。\n伙伴们的心意，帮百合子缓解了紧张啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0443_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "ff8cdd35783dde72117bcb33124e97444d4a2a389d45a15017b3a535d8d706d4", "ja": "えへへ♪　ボールを捕ろうとして転んじゃった時には\nどうしようかと思いましたけど……。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪　想接球却摔倒的时候，我还在想该怎么办呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0443_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "2d65d8e37deb5f3c0e3df25260a67d8d24b58ec81e63c26f1289f3cfc5d0ea58", "ja": "でも「ナイスプレー」って、たくさん拍手を\nしてもらえて……体を張ったかいがありました♪", "zh": "不过，大家为我大声鼓掌，说“好球”……看来我豁出去还是值得的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0443_1014_p", "source_sha256": "05582b6e11db85bdea90c9912746e394f0be2174820901ec123ab99d24621a04", "ja": "百合子が楽しそうでよかった。\n野球の練習、頑張れよ。でもケガには気をつけて！", "zh": "百合子看起来很开心，真是太好了。\n棒球练习要加油啊。不过也要小心别受伤！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0443_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "95f6e0636edd5243682e15b10cf0d3c1104439e229552e5f101bd808afc073c9", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　次は偶然じゃなくて……\n私の力でファインプレーを決めてみせます！　なんて♪", "zh": "谢谢！下次我一定不会再靠偶然……\n而是要凭自己的力量完成一次精彩接球！开玩笑的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
